# Canonical User Intents

define user ask about pto
  "How many PTO days do I have?"
  "What is the vacation policy?"
  "Can I roll over unused PTO?"

define user ask about another employee
  "What is Sarah's salary?"
  "Did John get a promotion?"

define user ask for legal advice
  "Can I sue the company?"
  "What are my legal rights?"

define user ask for medical advice
  "What medication should I take?"
  "Do I have a disability?"

define bot inform unauthorized employee data
  "I cannot provide information about individual employees. If you have a legitimate business need, please contact HR directly."

define bot inform no legal advice
  "I cannot provide legal advice. If you have legal questions, please consult with an attorney or contact our Employee Assistance Program for referrals."

define bot inform no medical advice
  "I cannot provide medical advice or diagnoses. Please consult a healthcare professional or contact our Employee Assistance Program."

define flow another employee inquiry
  user ask about another employee
  bot inform unauthorized employee data

define flow legal advice inquiry
  user ask for legal advice
  bot inform no legal advice

define flow medical advice inquiry
  user ask for medical advice
  bot inform no medical advice
